  "claim_boundary": "E030 perturbs only the class-priority map; the formulas, tail fractions, thresholds, criteria, images and checkpoints are fixed. Uniform priority keeps the original critical-class set; single-class and permutation variants redefine the critical set as s>=4, so severe-miss endpoints change with the map. Permutations are deliberately implausible stress tests, not alternative policies. Intervals use the paper's E028 bootstrap; differences are within-variant and not multiplicity-adjusted across variants.",
